25
00:00:22,971 --> 00:00:23,214
Two rules settle it.

26
00:00:23,214 --> 00:00:23,457
First, if you cannot read the label, that
container is finished, no exceptions,

27
00:00:23,457 --> 00:00:23,700
because an unlabelled garden chemical
cannot be used safely by you or by anyone who

28
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:23,943
